{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Equilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is inscribed in a circle. A second circle is tangent internally to the circumcircle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and tangent to sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />. If side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, then segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab17967324fc2b12349c0610c6c256f4c829162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> has length\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/6/1e6b015b8e5122a82c76eb54c2424728ea931382.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)); pair B = origin; pair A = dir(60); pair C = dir(0); pair circ = circumcenter(A,B,C); pair P = intersectionpoint(circ--(circ + (-1,0)),A--B); pair Q = intersectionpoint(circ--(circ + (1,0)),A--C); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SE); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,P,NW); label(&quot;$Q$&quot;,Q,NE); label(&quot;$T$&quot;,(0.5,-0.3),S); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(circumcircle(A,B,C)); draw(P--Q); draw(Circle((0.5,0.09),0.385)); [/asy]\" width=\"222\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/3/323df105e15a6ada909e07b403fcfe0ed6e35a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6\\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 8\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8\\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"397\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be the center of the smaller circle, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be its radius.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70d65f9acc587928f84f8c7c8c5755e2da24b6d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OT = OP = OQ = r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/0/d4004c6c92af9bd0e8be5f1f24c37ef713fa470d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AO = 2r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/a/39a2e986f5740b99d5f4b55ff7c5970dca4b277a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AOP$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1fcf07989db9ac3eeb06eeab0f34dda033f679c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AOQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"17\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c78b85058ee5e17f88e2cde302e48aad826b35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-60-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> triangles.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/9/8c93fe06593c86cf148de87835e03a31a6e6722e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AT = 3r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dc287ecc66c753041a3ad3119f824f92e3166df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AOP \\sim \\triangle ATB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ffadb56ef770f0a6fe013a23ba9dc2d25cffee5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AP}{AB} = \\frac{AO}{AT} = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"128\" height=\"39\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/7/437e65d3735fb1dadf06a8dc9c3d588e451252d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/9/6e953fc23cf972dbf5d4c51592712267645066ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP = 8$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/c/05c8d15fe9980ce0119892ba84301e5b5544af62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/2/dc233d3e097d83bdeb1caed0fe6a06b90b8195dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"36\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-